## Convenience export

The helper also exports `useIsMobile` for parity with COSS and shadcn's `use-mobile` pattern:

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { useIsMobile } from "@/hooks/use-media-query.svelte.js";

  const isMobile = useIsMobile(); // equivalent to useMediaQuery("max-md")
</script>
```
